title: Remove pallet::getter usage from pallet-derivatives
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Replaces the `#[pallet::getter]` attributes of `pallet-derivatives` with explicit public
    functions on `Pallet<T, I>`. `original_to_derivative()`, `derivative_to_original()` and
    `derivative_extra()` keep their signatures, so no changes are needed downstream.
crates:
- name: pallet-derivatives
  bump: patch
